{"data":[{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","conversation_id":"2108789831577071627","created_at":"2026-10-10T05:20:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108789831577071627"],"id":"2108789831577071627","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4526,"like_count":10,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":0},"text":"或许也有人爱爱我，就像我爱阳光，爱大海。或许我也会爱爱人，就像我爱阳光，爱大海。\n我的爱人，会从晨雾中走来。会带来月亮，带来星辰。我们会在晨雾中相识，在午后热恋，在日落时浪漫，在夜晚时死亡。","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2108789831577071627"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","conversation_id":"2108789038312210575","created_at":"2026-10-10T05:18:30.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108789248619098515"],"id":"2108789248619098515","in_reply_to_user_id":"2093646888264478721","lang":"ja","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3374,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2108789038312210575","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"今生若是同淋雪，此生也是共白头","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2108789248619098515"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","conversation_id":"2108789038312210575","created_at":"2026-10-10T05:17:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108789038312210575"],"id":"2108789038312210575","lang":"zh","note_tweet":{"text":"我好喜欢下雪天呀\n\n冬天就可以有理由跟恋人靠得近一些了。两人互相依偎着，一起吃糖炒板栗，手放在对方的口袋里取暖，抱抱的时候还可以被大大的羽绒服包裹住，好温暖呀。想看他被冻得有些红的耳垂和鼻尖，想要帮他清理落在发尖的雪。想看他在大雪中穿着黑色大衣，抱着一大束花，带着满腔的爱意向我走来。然后再扑进他的怀里，闻着花香和他身上的香味……想一起去看初雪，在雪地上踩出脚印，一起搭一个雪人，两个雪人一个是他一个是我，在这个冬天就一直依偎在一起。想靠在火炉边取暖，听着舒缓的音乐，靠在他的腿上睡去……想做的事情，经历的事情有好多好多……\n\n我是纯爱党呀╥⁠﹏⁠╥⁠"},"public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":6986,"like_count":35,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":7},"text":"我好喜欢下雪天呀","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2108789038312210575"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","conversation_id":"2108786507586896066","created_at":"2026-10-10T05:07:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108786507586896066"],"id":"2108786507586896066","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":83,"impression_count":39419,"like_count":1366,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":29,"retweet_count":63},"text":"做爱就是要有爱做着才爽啊😡想象一下他在床上恨不得把你当飞机杯一样玩坏，但嘴里却一直喊着：“好爱你啊宝宝，好乖的宝宝”\n结束后又是抱去洗澡又是换床单的，收拾完之后互相相拥在一起，对对方说有多爱多爱对方……没有aftercare的做爱，没有爱的做爱都是不完美的😡","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2108786507586896066"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","conversation_id":"2108785728176238848","created_at":"2026-10-10T05:04:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108785728176238848"],"id":"2108785728176238848","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":13137,"like_count":278,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":17,"retweet_count":8},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2108611343150456969","type":"quoted"}],"text":"我：我是sub\n某些男性看到的：我是免费飞机杯\n然后私信我：骚母狗来给爸爸免费送逼 https://t.co/fhVW0jYqMv","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2108785728176238848"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","conversation_id":"2108784997091971227","created_at":"2026-10-10T05:01:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108784997091971227"],"id":"2108784997091971227","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":228,"impression_count":63991,"like_count":983,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":36,"retweet_count":9},"text":"［被爸爸发现偷看黄片之后给爸爸献上了初夜］（含伪父女，长篇预警）\n好想舔……我抬头渴求着他：“爸爸，贱奴好想给您舔”\n“乖”他微喘着：“摇摇屁股，学狗叫，就给你舔”\n“汪汪！”我学得有模有样，屁股也笨拙地摇摆了起来。\n“舔吧”\n我有些紧张地张开嘴，用舌头认真的舔舐着，用嘴学着视频里那样吮吸着。 https://t.co/npfHVRfcXV","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2108784997091971227"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","conversation_id":"2108778938923425825","created_at":"2026-10-10T04:37:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108778938923425825"],"id":"2108778938923425825","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":3816,"like_count":20,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"text":"写了一段2149字的伪父女po文不知道有没有人看（担心太长&gt;&lt;）","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2108778938923425825"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","conversation_id":"2108593314111115358","created_at":"2026-10-09T16:19:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108593314111115358"],"id":"2108593314111115358","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":88,"impression_count":56437,"like_count":1674,"quote_count":38,"reply_count":43,"retweet_count":89},"text":"哥哥和爸爸就是不一样的啊……哥哥有一种青涩感，清爽的年上感。爸爸有一种粗壮感，很有经验的样子，严厉沉稳的年上感……\n但是更爽的是，如果谈到哥哥了，谈久点等到哥哥变成爸爸就可以品鉴两份美味了……","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2108593314111115358"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","conversation_id":"2108592732474396826","created_at":"2026-10-09T16:17:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108592732474396826"],"id":"2108592732474396826","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":28,"impression_count":28753,"like_count":195,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":21,"retweet_count":1},"text":"因为学过舞蹈所以现在看所有和舞蹈有关的调教玩法（如裸体跳舞塞跳蛋）都会萎。","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2108592732474396826"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","conversation_id":"2108589404898078978","created_at":"2026-10-09T16:04:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108589404898078978"],"id":"2108589404898078978","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":4499,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"你们骗我，送别的时候才没有晚风拂柳笛声残，夕阳山外山","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2108589404898078978"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","conversation_id":"2108565469674291249","created_at":"2026-10-09T15:23:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108578997814825382"],"id":"2108578997814825382","in_reply_to_user_id":"2093646888264478721","lang":"ja","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2993,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2108565469674291249","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"阈值。","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2108578997814825382"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","conversation_id":"2108569906841301165","created_at":"2026-10-09T14:46:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108569906841301165"],"id":"2108569906841301165","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":11690,"like_count":55,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":18,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我敢在和家里人一起睡一个房间的时候自慰（）","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2108569906841301165"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","conversation_id":"2108568081740259484","created_at":"2026-10-09T14:39:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108568081740259484"],"id":"2108568081740259484","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":106,"impression_count":46197,"like_count":232,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我在找一本我很久之前看的黄文，不知道有没有人看过。女主是学生，男主是女主的老师。女主是属于那种偏科学霸，男主刚好就是女主偏的那一科的老师。他们相遇的第一面就是女主被男主强奸，被调教了。女主是属于童颜巨乳。然后后面就是调教的内容什么的。剧情大概是这样的，结局还是he来着，后面还结婚了","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2108568081740259484"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","conversation_id":"2108566059867619662","created_at":"2026-10-09T14:31:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108566059867619662"],"id":"2108566059867619662","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":7844,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":0},"text":"用异物插逼会不会出血受伤啊😦","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2108566059867619662"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","conversation_id":"2108565573206712483","created_at":"2026-10-09T14:29:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108565573206712483"],"id":"2108565573206712483","lang":"art","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4001,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2108370051263066524","type":"quoted"}],"text":"😦 https://t.co/EBNtAuXROQ","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2108565573206712483"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","conversation_id":"2108565469674291249","created_at":"2026-10-09T14:29:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108565469674291249"],"id":"2108565469674291249","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3852,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"哦